<p>Zikre ghame hussain se mehfil saji rahi<br />
gul ho gaya charaagh magar roushni rahi</p>

<p>akbar ke baad zeest me kya dilkashi rahi<br />
laila tamaam umr yahi sonchti rahi</p>

<p>qaime furaaat se to hataae gaye magar<br />
Abbase naamdaar ki tyori chadhi rahi</p>

<p>abbas lene aaye jo maidaan ki riza<br />
zainab bas apne baazuo'n ko dekhti rahi</p>

<p>Ashke ghame hussain ka toota na silsila<br />
roomaale fatima me hamesha nami rahi</p>

<p>balwe me berida sare zainab ko dekhkar<br />
Allah jaane kaise qayaamat ruki rahi</p>